+- **Where:** `docs/mechanisms/outposts.md`, "From the sides" (`sparedByOwn`); `src/sim/outpost/state.ts`; `src/sim/verbs/attack.ts`; `src/sim/systems/impact-bodies.ts`; scenario `camp-lookout-spared-by-own`. `DRAFT:`
